pairs 122
new project	Make a folder and run makej init -pro NAME.
install yt-dlp	Run jget tool python yt-dlp. Use it only for what you may download.
change colours	Type jaric theme NAME, for example jaric theme amber.
how do i edit a file	Run coderin FILE. Save with Ctrl-S and quit with Ctrl-Q.
good morning	Hi! I am xaiorin, your helper. Ask me about the tools.
how do i read a video file	Run jvp4 info FILE.
what language is this	J2K is the language of Jaric. Its compiler is jcmp.
what is j2k	J2K is the language of Jaric. Its compiler is jcmp.
how do i install a tool	Use jget tool NAME, for example jget tool mujic.
ตั้งค่ายังไง	พิมพ์ jaric setting
hello	Hi! I am xaiorin, your helper. Ask me about the tools.
where is the model	In the folder .neuron in your home. Run xr where to see it.
what is jash	jash keeps the settings of your programs in the file .jash. Use jash list and jash set.
run a script from the net	jget -jsh URL. Only use addresses you trust.
stop xr	Run xr stop.
เล่นเพลงยังไง	พิมพ์ mujic แล้วพิมพ์ชื่อเพลง
search text	Run grep -n WORD FILE.
how do i add my songs	In mujic type /import PATH, or put the files in the folder music.
hi	Hi! I am xaiorin, your helper. Ask me about the tools.
how do i see the lyrics	In mujic type /lyrics get, then /lyrics.
how do i start a project	Make a folder and run makej init -pro NAME.
restart jaric	Type jaric -restart.
show lyrics	In mujic type /lyrics get, then /lyrics.
how do i delete what you saw	Run xr forget. It deletes the events and the learned text.
what can you do	I can tell you how to use jget, makej, jsh, mujic, python and the other tools.
task manager	Run jamanager ps, or jamanager top.
how do i play music	Type mujic. Then write part of a song name and press Enter.
new session	Tap + at the top, or type start PROGRAM.
ลาก่อน	แล้วพบกันใหม่ครับ
how do i install pip	pip comes with the tool python: jget tool python.
start xr	Run xr start. It runs in the background.
how do i install python	Run jget tool python. Then python3 and pip work.
how do i start the assistant	Run xr start. It runs in the background.
hey	Hi! I am xaiorin, your helper. Ask me about the tools.
how do i change the theme	Type jaric theme NAME, for example jaric theme amber.
bigger letters	In jaric setting choose font size, or pinch the screen.
ติดตั้งเครื่องมือยังไง	ใช้คำสั่ง jget tool ชื่อเครื่องมือ
สวัสดี	สวัสดีครับ ผมคือ xaiorin ผู้ช่วยของคุณ
thanks	You are welcome.
kill a program	Run jamanager kill PID.
what is makej	makej is the build tool. makej builds, makej run runs, makej -j builds on many cores.
ขอบคุณ	ยินดีครับ
what is jw	A .jw file is a model of neuron, the whole AI in one file.
how do i make an ai	Run makej init -ai, edit data/chat.txt, then makej train.
untar	Run tarj x FILE.tar.gz.
how do i download and run a script	jget -jsh URL. Only use addresses you trust.
install python	Run jget tool python. Then python3 and pip work.
run my program	After jcmp hello.jk -o hello type ./hello.
what does makej do	makej is the build tool. makej builds, makej run runs, makej -j builds on many cores.
how do i sort songs into folders	In mujic type /mv NAME FOLDER.
how do i make a game	Run makej init -game and then makej run.
download a file	Run jget URL. It shows a progress bar.
import songs	In mujic type /import PATH, or put the files in the folder music.
xr forget	Run xr forget. It deletes the events and the learned text.
how do i stop the assistant	Run xr stop.
video info	Run jvp4 info FILE.
how do i open a zip file	Run unj FILE.zip.
how do i restart the app	Type jaric -restart.
ดูโปรแกรมที่รันอยู่	ใช้คำสั่ง jamanager ps
unzip	Run unj FILE.zip.
compile a program	Write hello.jk and run jcmp hello.jk -o hello.
how do i stop a program	Run jamanager kill PID.
how do i run a script	Write the file with [#jsh] on the first line and run jsh file.jsh.
move a song	In mujic type /mv NAME FOLDER.
how do i talk to you	Type xr and a question, or just xr to chat.
play video	Run jaric video FILE.
open the editor	Run coderin FILE. Save with Ctrl-S and quit with Ctrl-Q.
how do i update the compiler	Run jget tool jcmp. makej needs jcmp 1.2.0.0 or newer.
zip a folder	Run zipj out.zip FOLDER.
what is the jash file	jash keeps the settings of your programs in the file .jash. Use jash list and jash set.
คุณชื่ออะไร	ผมชื่อ xaiorin เรียกสั้นๆ ว่า xr
xr learn	Turn on the setting in jaric setting, use the shell, then run xr learn.
how do i install yt-dlp	Run jget tool python yt-dlp. Use it only for what you may download.
see you	Goodbye! See you.
where is pip	pip comes with the tool python: jget tool python.
how do i download a file	Run jget URL. It shows a progress bar.
train an ai	Run makej init -ai, edit data/chat.txt, then makej train.
how do i make a zip file	Run zipj out.zip FOLDER.
how do i find a word in files	Run grep -n WORD FILE.
check memory	Run jamanager mem.
how do i update jget	Run jget --update.
what is a jc file	A .jc file is a program package of Jaric, made by makej pack.
start a game	Run makej init -game and then makej run.
install a tool	Use jget tool NAME, for example jget tool mujic.
free space	Run jamanager drives.
what is your name	I am xaiorin, xr for short, a small model that runs on your phone.
show files	Run dir. Use dir -a to see hidden ones.
ติดตั้ง python ยังไง	ใช้คำสั่ง jget tool python
แก้ไขไฟล์ยังไง	ใช้คำสั่ง coderin ชื่อไฟล์
how do i open a tar file	Run tarj x FILE.tar.gz.
open settings	Type jaric setting. Use the arrows and Enter.
how do i see a video file	Run jaric video FILE.
what is this app	Jaric is a terminal app with its own shell, tools and a language.
how do i list files	Run dir. Use dir -a to see hidden ones.
how do i open a new tab	Tap + at the top, or type start PROGRAM.
how do i build a program	Write hello.jk and run jcmp hello.jk -o hello.
help	I can tell you how to use jget, makej, jsh, mujic, python and the other tools.
how do i change the settings	Type jaric setting. Use the arrows and Enter.
what is jaric	Jaric is a terminal app with its own shell, tools and a language.
how do i get free music	In mujic type /get and choose a free song.
how do i see the disk	Run jamanager drives.
what is a jw file	A .jw file is a model of neuron, the whole AI in one file.
how do i run a program	After jcmp hello.jk -o hello type ./hello.
how do you do	I am fine, thank you. What do you want to do?
play a song	Type mujic. Then write part of a song name and press Enter.
fetch a song	In mujic type /get and choose a free song.
bye	Goodbye! See you.
who are you	I am xaiorin, xr for short, a small model that runs on your phone.
update jcmp	Run jget tool jcmp. makej needs jcmp 1.2.0.0 or newer.
how do i see running programs	Run jamanager ps, or jamanager top.
how are you	I am fine, thank you. What do you want to do?
how do i change the font size	In jaric setting choose font size, or pinch the screen.
how do i make you learn	Turn on the setting in jaric setting, use the shell, then run xr learn.
goodbye	Goodbye! See you.
how much memory is free	Run jamanager mem.
what is jc	A .jc file is a program package of Jaric, made by makej pack.
thank you	You are welcome.
your name	I am xaiorin, xr for short, a small model that runs on your phone.
run a jsh script	Write the file with [#jsh] on the first line and run jsh file.jsh.
where are your files	In the folder .neuron in your home. Run xr where to see it.
update jget	Run jget --update.
how to use xr	Type xr and a question, or just xr to chat.
